{
  "v": 5,
  "id": "f0885f74-ca83-4b6f-99f5-3b30ecb4913c",
  "title": "03 과업 유상·무상 지원계획 — 전략·경영평가·성과지표 연계성 강화 방안",
  "canvas": {
    "w": 1280,
    "h": 905
  },
  "source": {
    "kind": "kg-html",
    "html": "<section class=\"kg-slide kg-root\" data-screen-label=\"지표 연계성 강화형\">\n  <header class=\"kg-header\">\n    <div class=\"kg-header__media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__num kg-section-num\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__titles\">\n      <div class=\"kg-section-title\">과업 유상·무상 지원계획</div>\n      <div class=\"kg-section-sub\">전략·경영평가·성과지표 연계성 강화 방안</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kg-chapter-tab\">\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__roman\">IV</span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__sep\"></span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tag\">성과관리 제도 개선</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"kg-msgband\"><span class=\"kg-msgband__mark\"></span>\n    <p class=\"kg-message\">부서 KPI 유형화·연계성 분석·대표성 평가로 전사 전략과 부서·개인 성과를 연결</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kg-body-area\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"wrap__t\" data-kg-role=\"h1\">KPI 전략 연계성 강화 및 관리체계 고도화 절차</div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n\n        <!-- ===== 1 ===== -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">\n            <span class=\"ch__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">1</span>\n            <span class=\"ch__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">부서 KPI 세분화</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cb\">\n            <div class=\"t1\">\n              <div class=\"c c--v\" style=\"grid-row:3/10;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">부서 고유지표</div>\n\n              <div class=\"c c--h\" style=\"grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">구분</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--h\" style=\"grid-column:3/6;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">지표유형</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--h\" style=\"grid-column:3;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">유형</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--h\" style=\"grid-column:4;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">비계량 KPI</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--h\" style=\"grid-column:5;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">계량 KPI</div>\n\n              <div class=\"c c--g\" style=\"grid-column:2;grid-row:3/7;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">대외지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--k\" style=\"grid-column:3;grid-row:3/6;\" data-kg-role=\"num\">G</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">경영평가편람 연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">국가주관 공공기관 평가지표 연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">기관장 평가 연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--k\" style=\"grid-column:3;\" data-kg-role=\"num\">B</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">주무부처 승인 기관업무계획 연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:5;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">업무계획 계량지표 및 감독규정 연계지표</div>\n\n              <div class=\"c c--g\" style=\"grid-column:2;grid-row:7/9;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">내부지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--k\" style=\"grid-column:3;\" data-kg-role=\"num\">S</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">전략과제 연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--k\" style=\"grid-column:3;\" data-kg-role=\"num\">P</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">부서고유과제 연계지표</div>\n\n              <div class=\"c c--g\" style=\"grid-column:2;\" data-kg-role=\"label\">보조지표</div>\n              <div class=\"c c--k\" style=\"grid-column:3;\" data-kg-role=\"num\">C</div>\n              <div class=\"c\" style=\"grid-column:4/6;\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">부서 간 공통관리지표</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ext\">\n              <div class=\"ext__h\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">대외평가연계지표</div>\n              <div class=\"ext__r\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">경영평가 비계량지표 관련 부서별 담당률 평가결과·개선도</div>\n              <div class=\"ext__r ext__r--off\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">협업도 평가지표·기관발전기여도 지표 등 기타</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cc\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">지표 유형화 및 G·B 지표 비율·배점 지정 기반<br>지표별 전략·평가 연계성 강화</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ===== 2 ===== -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">\n            <span class=\"ch__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">2</span>\n            <span class=\"ch__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">지표 연계 층위 분석(Cascading Map)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cb\">\n            <div class=\"mapfig\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 400\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <!-- 계층 간 매핑선 : 전사 → 본부 → 부서 → 개인 -->\n                <g stroke=\"var(--gray-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" fill=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M64 38 V72\"></path><path d=\"M64 38 L116 72\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M116 38 V72\"></path><path d=\"M116 38 L168 72\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M168 38 V72\"></path><path d=\"M168 38 L220 72\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M220 38 V72\"></path><path d=\"M220 38 L272 72\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M272 38 V72\"></path><path d=\"M272 38 L220 72\"></path>\n\n                  <path d=\"M64 102 L57 146\"></path><path d=\"M64 102 L94 146\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M116 102 L94 146\"></path><path d=\"M116 102 L131 146\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M168 102 L168 146\"></path><path d=\"M168 102 L205 146\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M220 102 L205 146\"></path><path d=\"M220 102 L242 146\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M272 102 L279 146\"></path><path d=\"M272 102 L242 146\"></path>\n                </g>\n                <g stroke=\"var(--gray-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\">\n                  <path d=\"M57 200 L112 240\"></path><path d=\"M94 200 L140 240\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M131 200 L168 240\"></path><path d=\"M168 200 L196 240\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M205 200 L225 240\"></path><path d=\"M242 200 L253 240\"></path>\n                  <path d=\"M279 200 L282 240\"></path>\n                </g>\n\n                <!-- 층위 라벨 -->\n                <g fill=\"#1F497D\">\n                  <rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"32\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"2\" y=\"72\" width=\"32\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"2\" y=\"146\" width=\"32\" height=\"54\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"2\" y=\"240\" width=\"32\" height=\"112\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                  <text x=\"18\" y=\"27\">전사</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"91\">본부</text>\n                  <text x=\"18\" y=\"177\">부서</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"300\">개인</text>\n                </g>\n\n                <!-- 전사 -->\n                <g fill=\"#1F497D\">\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"92\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"144\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"196\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <rect x=\"248\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--gray-400)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"></rect>\n                <g font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                  <g fill=\"var(--paper)\">\n                    <text x=\"64\" y=\"21\">전략</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"32\">과제</text>\n                    <text x=\"116\" y=\"21\">전략</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"32\">과제</text>\n                    <text x=\"168\" y=\"21\">전략</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"32\">과제</text>\n                    <text x=\"220\" y=\"21\">전략</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"32\">과제</text>\n                  </g>\n                  <g fill=\"var(--ink-500)\"><text x=\"272\" y=\"21\">전략</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"32\">과제</text></g>\n                </g>\n\n                <!-- 본부 -->\n                <g fill=\"#DCE6F3\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\">\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"72\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"92\" y=\"72\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"144\" y=\"72\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"248\" y=\"72\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <rect x=\"196\" y=\"72\" width=\"48\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--gray-400)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"></rect>\n                <g font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                  <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                    <text x=\"64\" y=\"85\">업무</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"96\">목표</text>\n                    <text x=\"116\" y=\"85\">업무</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"96\">목표</text>\n                    <text x=\"168\" y=\"85\">업무</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"96\">목표</text>\n                    <text x=\"272\" y=\"85\">업무</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"96\">목표</text>\n                  </g>\n                  <g fill=\"var(--ink-500)\"><text x=\"220\" y=\"85\">업무</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"96\">목표</text></g>\n                </g>\n\n                <!-- 부서 -->\n                <g fill=\"#DCE6F3\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\">\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"77\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"151\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"188\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"262\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"77\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"114\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"151\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"262\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--gray-400)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\">\n                  <rect x=\"114\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"225\" y=\"146\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"188\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"225\" y=\"176\" width=\"34\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                  <g fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">\n                    <text x=\"57\" y=\"162\">G</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"162\">S</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"162\">G</text>\n                    <text x=\"205\" y=\"162\">C</text><text x=\"279\" y=\"162\">P</text>\n                    <text x=\"57\" y=\"192\">B</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"192\">G</text><text x=\"131\" y=\"192\">S</text>\n                    <text x=\"168\" y=\"192\">P</text><text x=\"279\" y=\"192\">P</text>\n                  </g>\n                  <g fill=\"var(--ink-500)\">\n                    <text x=\"131\" y=\"162\">B</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"162\">C</text>\n                    <text x=\"205\" y=\"192\">G</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"192\">S</text>\n                  </g>\n                </g>\n\n                <!-- 개인 -->\n                <g fill=\"#DCE6F3\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\">\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"240\" width=\"54\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"40\" y=\"268\" width=\"54\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"296\" width=\"54\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"40\" y=\"324\" width=\"54\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                  <text x=\"67\" y=\"256\">전략 KPI</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"284\">자율 KPI</text>\n                  <text x=\"67\" y=\"312\">계량 KPI</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"340\">공통 KPI</text>\n                </g>\n                <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\">\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"127\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"156\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"272\" y=\"240\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"127\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"156\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"272\" y=\"268\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"127\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"156\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"272\" y=\"296\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"127\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"156\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"272\" y=\"324\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g fill=\"#DCE6F3\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\">\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"156\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"127\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"268\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"156\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"272\" y=\"296\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <rect x=\"98\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"185\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"243\" y=\"324\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n                <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--gray-400)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\">\n                  <rect x=\"127\" y=\"240\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"214\" y=\"296\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                </g>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"two\">\n              <div class=\"two__i\">\n                <span class=\"two__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">부서</span>\n                <span class=\"two__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">본부 목표 설정에 따른 유형별 지표 구성 분석</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"two__i\">\n                <span class=\"two__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">개인</span>\n                <span class=\"two__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">부서 KPI와 연계되는 전략 KPI 구분</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cc\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">전사 지표 분석 기반 연계 미흡 지표 도출</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ===== 3 ===== -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"ch\">\n            <span class=\"ch__n\" data-kg-role=\"num\">3</span>\n            <span class=\"ch__t\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">지표 정밀화·연계성 강화</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cb\">\n            <div class=\"t3\">\n              <div class=\"t3__h\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">지표대표성 사전평가</div>\n\n              <div class=\"t3__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">평가 대상</div>\n              <div class=\"t3__v t3__v--p\"><span data-kg-role=\"caption\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-navy);\">신규 및 변경지표</span></div>\n\n              <div class=\"t3__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">평가 주체</div>\n              <div class=\"t3__v\">\n                <div class=\"mut\">\n                  <span class=\"mut__b\" data-kg-role=\"label\">사업부서</span>\n                  <span class=\"mut__l\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mut__c\" data-kg-role=\"label\">부서 간<br>상호평가</span>\n                  <span class=\"mut__r\"></span>\n                  <span class=\"mut__b\" data-kg-role=\"label\">지원부서</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt\">\n                  <div class=\"h\" data-kg-role=\"label\">피평가지표</div><div class=\"h\" data-kg-role=\"label\">사업부서</div><div class=\"h\" data-kg-role=\"label\">지원부서</div>\n                  <div class=\"k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">사업부서</div><div data-kg-role=\"label\">30%</div><div data-kg-role=\"label\">70%</div>\n                  <div class=\"k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">지원부서</div><div data-kg-role=\"label\">70%</div><div data-kg-role=\"label\">30%</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"t3__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">평가 항목</div>\n              <div class=\"t3__v\">\n                <div class=\"cr\">\n                  <span class=\"cr__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">구체성</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">지표가 구체적이고 명확한가</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__p\" data-kg-role=\"label\">25%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cr\">\n                  <span class=\"cr__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">측정가능성</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">객관적 측정이 가능한가</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__p\" data-kg-role=\"label\">15%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cr\">\n                  <span class=\"cr__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">전략연계성</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">경영목표·전략과 연계되어 있는가</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__p\" data-kg-role=\"label\">30%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cr\">\n                  <span class=\"cr__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">통제가능성</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">부서의 노력을 통해 성과창출이 가능한가</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__p\" data-kg-role=\"label\">20%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cr\">\n                  <span class=\"cr__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">기한성</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__v\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">달성기한·조건이 명확한가</span>\n                  <span class=\"cr__p\" data-kg-role=\"label\">10%</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"t3__k\" data-kg-role=\"label\">결과 활용</div>\n              <div class=\"t3__v\">\n                <span class=\"use\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">평균점수 80점 미만 시 반려</span>\n                <span class=\"use\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">반려지표를 계속 운영할 경우 배점 10% 감점</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cc\" data-kg-role=\"h3\">지표대표성 평가·SMART 분석 기반 지표 정밀화<br>(영향 시기·단계·연계 수준 등)</div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"kg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__src\">JDC 중장기 경영전략체계 진단 및 수립 — 전략·경영평가·성과지표 연계성 강화 방안</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__page\">53</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__logo\"><img src=\"/kg/assets/keynes-group-logo.png\" alt=\"Keynes Group\"></span>\n  </footer>\n</section>",
    "css": ".wrap{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:7px;margin-top:7px;}\n  .wrap__t{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n\n  .cols{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.16fr 1fr 1.16fr;gap:10px;min-height:0;}\n  .cl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;min-width:0;gap:7px;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;padding:5px;}\n  .ch{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:4px 8px;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,var(--hatch) 0 1px,transparent 1px 6px),#EDF1F6;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;}\n  .ch__n{flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--navy-800);color:#fff;\n    font-size:12px;font-weight:800;}\n  .ch__t{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n  .cb{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:4px;}\n  .cc{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);\n    line-height:1.26;border:1.5px solid var(--navy-800);border-radius:3px;padding:5px 8px;}\n\n  /* ---- 1열 : 유형 분류표 ---- */\n  .t1{flex:2.1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px 60px 30px 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-auto-rows:1fr;gap:2px;min-height:0;}\n  .c{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    font-size:13px;line-height:1.18;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;\n    padding:2px 4px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink-900);}\n  .c--h{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;font-weight:800;border-color:#1F497D;}\n  .c--g{background:var(--neutral-100);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n  .c--k{background:#DCE6F3;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);font-size:14px;}\n  .c--v{writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:upright;letter-spacing:1px;\n    background:var(--neutral-100);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n\n  .ext{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-auto-rows:1fr;gap:2px;min-height:0;}\n  .ext__h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8A93A0,#6E7784);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;\n    border-radius:2px;padding:3px 6px;}\n  .ext__r{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;\n    padding:3px 6px;color:var(--ink-900);}\n  .ext__r--off{background:var(--neutral-100);color:var(--ink-500);}\n\n  /* ---- 2열 : 계층 전개 맵 (연결선 때문에 통째로 SVG) ---- */\n  .mapfig{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;}\n  .mapfig svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;}\n\n  .two{flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5px;}\n  .two__i{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:5px;}\n  .two__k{flex:0 0 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;border-radius:2px;\n    font-size:12px;font-weight:800;}\n  .two__v{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;\n    color:var(--ink-900);border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;padding:4px 6px;}\n\n  /* ---- 3열 : 대표성 평가표 ---- */\n  .t3{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:74px 1fr;grid-auto-rows:auto;gap:3px;min-height:0;\n    align-content:space-between;}\n  .t3__h{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8A93A0,#6E7784);border-radius:2px;padding:4px 6px;}\n  .t3__k{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    background:var(--neutral-100);border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;\n    font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);padding:4px 3px;line-height:1.2;}\n  .t3__v{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:4px;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;padding:5px 6px;background:#fff;}\n  .t3__v--p{align-items:center;}\n\n  .mut{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;}\n  .mut__b{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);\n    background:#DCE6F3;border:1px solid var(--blue-400);border-radius:2px;padding:4px 3px;}\n  .mut__c{flex:0 0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);line-height:1.15;}\n  .mut__l,.mut__r{flex:0 0 auto;width:0;height:0;\n    border-top:5px solid transparent;border-bottom:5px solid transparent;}\n  .mut__l{border-right:8px solid var(--blue-500);}\n  .mut__r{border-left:8px solid var(--blue-500);}\n\n  .mt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2px;}\n  .mt div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    font-size:12px;line-height:1.15;border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;padding:3px 2px;}\n  .mt .h{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8A93A0,#6E7784);color:#fff;font-weight:800;border-color:#6E7784;}\n  .mt .k{background:var(--neutral-100);font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n\n  .cr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:78px 1fr 42px;gap:3px;}\n  .cr__k{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    background:#DCE6F3;border:1px solid var(--blue-400);border-radius:2px;\n    font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy-800);padding:3px 2px;line-height:1.15;}\n  .cr__v{display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ink-900);\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:2px;padding:3px 6px;}\n  .cr__p{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--navy-800);background:var(--neutral-100);border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);\n    border-radius:2px;}\n\n  .use{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ink-900);}\n  .use::before{content:\"\";flex:0 0 auto;width:5px;height:5px;margin-top:5px;\n    background:var(--navy-800);border-radius:1px;}",
